T=>UnMasked + OC Page<=T
" Man, gamejams are exhausting. Yet there is a lot to gain from them. "
" Last weekend I participated in Global Game Jam [Athens] and, for the first time, actually finished a gamejam game. The jam was 2 days long, and an in-person event. "
<br>
" I was working together with 7 other people from my uni. One from my sector, 6 from another. Although I knew none of them before this. "
" It was perhaps the first time I've worked with other people in programming. I didn't understand git branches until now. "
<br>
" The game that came out of the whole thing was 'UnMasked', a 2.5D stealth game. "
" The core mechanic is a lot like capture from mario odyssey, you put the mask on other creatures to control them. "
<br>
" I was the lead programmer, as in the only one experienced enough in Godot who could really make the game in the small 2 day timespan, so I ended up sleeping in the building the first day, working on the game mechanics while doing level design at the same time. "
" That isn't to say other people didn't controbute, far from it. "
" We had very skilled artists, musicians and a 3D artist in the team, and we managed to pull a pretty high quality game for jam standards. "
<br>
" Think the game sounds cool? You can play it right now from the brand new 'Other Projects' section of the site. "
" Pretty weird that that's new, huh? Until now I didn't have any public projects besides Mira's Journal and this site, so any new projects will probably go there. "
" ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ "
<br>
" This is a pretty long post and I've only talked about half the news. "
<br>
" There's now a brand new Characters page! The Mira's Journal characters used to have some stuff in /miras-journal, but everything has now been moved to /oc, with two new ones added! "
" I will slowly update these, perhaps adding more characters, or more content related to the characters in each one, who knows. "
<br><br>
" This has been the longest site update so far, thanks for reading! "